{"id":"660685","name":"芥末黄油蟹","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660685/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"螃蟹","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买螃蟹时让商家帮忙处理一下。","img":"images/660685/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"处理好的蟹清洗干净备用。","img":"images/660685/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头剁碎备用。","img":"images/660685/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香葱洗净切段备用。","img":"images/660685/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"碗中加入蚝油，芥末，生抽，盐，和适量淀粉水。","img":"images/660685/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/660685/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"螃蟹均匀给裹上一层淀粉。","img":"images/660685/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"裹好后下锅煎至金黄。","img":"images/660685/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蟹的其他部位翻炒一下。","img":"images/660685/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入蒜末炒出香味。","img":"images/660685/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入黄油炒香。","img":"images/660685/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入芥末汁。","img":"images/660685/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"大火煮开转小火焖。","img":"images/660685/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"焖入味后放入葱段翻炒几下即可出锅。","img":"images/660685/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660685/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660685/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660685/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}